{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなこだよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/09/29/0269626/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は全握ブログ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月20日に名古屋で全国握手会\n9月27日に幕張で全国握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の握手会は\nれいかさんとペアでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかさんを見ると安心します！\n8thのイベントで\n北海道にななみさんとれいかさんと\n行かせてもらえた時に\n飛行機の中で相談にのって頂いて\nそれからは、れいかさんを見ると\nなんだか安心しちゃうんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/09/29/0269626/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかさんとがおー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったれいかさんファンの方、ひなたぼっこの皆さんありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、27日の幕張は\nみさ先輩とペアでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩は、やっぱりお姉さん！って感じでセクシーでキレイで可愛くて\nとなりにいてつられそうになった！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩も、悩みを聞いて下さったりアドバイスをして下さったりとっても優しくして下さるんです(｡>ω<｡)♡\nいつもありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/09/29/0269626/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさーくるのみなさん、ひなたぼっこの皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目の全国握手会も終わってしまいましたね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会は、たくさんの方が会いにきて下さって楽しくてはじめましての方も多くてなんだかドキドキします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会にも、来てくださる皆さん\n本当にいつもありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会では、まったりと話せないから個別握手会は結構充実していて楽しいね٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のブログは、個別握手会のことです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいごにー、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/09/29/0269626/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん！らいおん！がおー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このらいおんと戦ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/09/29/0269626/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らいおんと同じ口をして\nにらみあった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/09/29/0269626/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対らいおんたべてやるんだ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p